4.  **Schedule SE:** To calculate self-employment tax on your net graphic design profit.
5.  **Schedule 1:** To report your Schedule C business income and claim your student loan interest deduction.
6.  **Student Loan Interest Deduction Worksheet:** To calculate how much of the $2,500 maximum you are allowed to claim based on your MAGI phase-out.
